        <name>use_entropy_gate</name>
        <qualifiedname>themis::rag::TARGConfig::use_entropy_gate</qualifiedname>
        <initializer>= false</initializer>
        <briefdescription>
<para>If true, also trigger retrieval when the entropy of the top-K probability mass exceeds <computeroutput><ref refid="structthemis_1_1rag_1_1_t_a_r_g_config_1aee6194ce3b01772064d09ca837adb265" kindref="member">entropy_threshold</ref></computeroutput>. This catches spread-uncertainty scenarios not captured by the gap metric. </para>
