        <definition>float themis::rag::TARGConfig::entropy_threshold</definition>
        <argsstring></argsstring>
        <name>entropy_threshold</name>
        <qualifiedname>themis::rag::TARGConfig::entropy_threshold</qualifiedname>
        <initializer>= 4.0f</initializer>
        <briefdescription>
<para>Entropy threshold in nats. Only used when use_entropy_gate = true. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>For a uniform distribution over V tokens: entropy = ln(V) ≈ 10.8 for V=50k. Typical &quot;uncertain&quot; threshold: 3.0–5.0 nats. </para>
        </detaileddescription>
